{"ref":"BDB, יָקַץ","hw":"יָקַץ","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יָקַץ</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. awake (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">يَقِظَ</span> <em>wake, be awake</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקָ֑ץ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.27\">1 K 18:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּיקַץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:16\" href=\"/Genesis.28.16\">Gn 28:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּיקֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:24\" href=\"/Genesis.9.24\">Gn 9:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּקַץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:20\" href=\"/Judges.16.20\">Ju 16:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:65\" href=\"/Psalms.78.65\">ψ 78:65</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.15\">1 K 3:15</a> (v Baer); <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאִיקָ֑ץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:21\" href=\"/Genesis.41.21\">Gn 41:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקְֽצוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.7\">Hb 2:7</a>;—<em>awake</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:4\" href=\"/Genesis.41.4\">Gn 41:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:7\" href=\"/Genesis.41.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:21\" href=\"/Genesis.41.21\">21</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 3:15\" href=\"/I_Kings.3.15\">1 K 3:15</a>; of Baal <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.27\">18:27</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְּׁנָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:16\" href=\"/Genesis.28.16\">Gn 28:16</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:14\" href=\"/Judges.16.14\">Ju 16:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:20\" href=\"/Judges.16.20\">20</a>, of Noah, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִיֵּינוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:24\" href=\"/Genesis.9.24\">Gn 9:24</a> (J), i. e. from drunken sleep; fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:65\" href=\"/Psalms.78.65\">ψ 78:65</a>, i. e. <em>become suddenly active;</em> of enemies <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.7\">Hb 2:7</a>.—Vid. also <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, קיץ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_קיץ\">קיץ</a>